{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16889","headline":"安邑里中秋怀寄高员外 · 武元衡","name":"安邑里中秋怀寄高员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"原宪素非贫，嵇康自寡欲。\n守道识通穷，达命齐荣辱。\n庭梧变葱蒨，篱菊扬芳馥。\n坠叶翻夕霜，高堂瞬华烛。\n况兹寒夜永，复叹流年促。\n感物思殷勤，怀贤心踯躅。\n雄词封禅草，丽句阳春曲。\n高德十年兄，异才千里足。\n咫尺邈雪霜，相望如琼玉。\n欲识岁寒心，松筠更秋绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}